{"slug": "steenkolen-handels-vereeniging", "synopsis": "This 1923 company film follows the Steenkolen Handels Vereeniging\u2019s coal business in Rotterdam. Men work with documents in the main office, while harbor scenes establish the waterfront setting and show boats, coal yards, and large handling structures.\\\\n\\\\nAt the docks, workers and machinery unload coal, sort it, move it through the facility, and place it in open railway wagons. Employees examine the loaded coal and complete paperwork before the train crosses the border and continues to Duisburg. A placard reading \u201cSteenkolen Duitschland Nederland\u201d connects the shipment with coal trade between Germany and the Netherlands.", "clips": [{"id": "813d1c7e-79e1-5b3f-a4eb-facbc72b0982", "sourceSlug": "steenkolen-handels-vereeniging", "sourceTitle": "Steenkolen Handels Vereeniging", "sourceYear": 1923, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 2.0, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/steenkolen-handels-vereeniging/clips/0000000000-0000002000.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/steenkolen-handels-vereeniging/thumbnails/0000000000-0000002000.jpg"}, {"id": "7bbd2c35-2874-5e0e-90ba-809eb1eab308", "sourceSlug": "steenkolen-handels-vereeniging", "sourceTitle": "Steenkolen Handels Vereeniging", "sourceYear": 1923, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 2.0, "endSeconds": 16.16, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/steenkolen-handels-vereeniging/clips/0000002000-0000016160.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/steenkolen-handels-vereeniging/thumbnails/0000002000-0000016160.jpg"}, {"id": "8e564e71-3db7-5147-84d4-27a14a23a54c", "sourceSlug": "steenkolen-handels-vereeniging", "sourceTitle": "Steenkolen Handels Vereeniging", "sourceYear": 1923, "position": 2, "startSeconds": 16.16, "endSeconds": 24.88, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc